A pancosmic performance collective of tantalizing singers that will fire you straight into the heart of their love galaxy. Heart Chor sings, moves, and performs out of joy, curiosity, and passion, radically spreading the message of LOVE. Self-love and acceptance are its core values. This is definitely not your typical choir so be ready to melt into a sexy supernova of nippelicious tunes!

